  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palau Public Utilities Corporation Reform Program (Subprogram 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program aims to strengthen state-owned enterprises in Palau by improving the corporate governance and financial management of Palau?s electricity and water utility company, Palau Public Utilities Corporation, and providing an enabling environment for private sector participation in the electricity and water subsectors in Palau. The program will support the government?s long-term reforms in electricity and water and sanitation.</narrative>
  </description>
